Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(sessions):=20hermes=20sessions=20branch=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?<id>=20=E2=80=94=20one-command=20hidden=20copy=20for=20probes?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20[daveey]?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

/branch is interactive-only, so an agent proving 'a turn on chat X works' resumed the
person's real chat with --oneshot and left its test prompt + token reply as the newest
turns (self-heal agent-93a55211b1). 'hermes sessions branch <id>' copies the transcript
(same rows/fields as /branch, now one owner: sessions_cmd_branch.branch_rows) and system
prompt into a root source=oneshot row marked _probe_copy_of, prints the new id, and
leaves the original untouched. --title/--source/--json optional.

Public mirror integration overlay: reconcile historical merge contexts to the frozen fork tree.
See core/mirror-1134-verification.md; this entry is not a standalone feature-only diff.
